WEBVTT

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:35.910
Colors

00:02:07.870 --> 00:02:09.700
It's so peaceful.

00:02:11.330 --> 00:02:13.040
But now is not the time for that!

00:02:13.290 --> 00:02:17.080
We keep the peace in this town! We are Colors!

00:02:17.080 --> 00:02:18.000
Yeah.

00:02:18.120 --> 00:02:20.450
Wake up, Leader! It's time to get changed!

00:02:21.330 --> 00:02:22.200
Huh?

00:02:42.580 --> 00:02:45.040
Why am I dressed like this, Sat-chan?

00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:48.450
Heroes don't ONLY do their job

00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:48.450
when the world is in crisis.

00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:49.950
Today is a day for training!

00:02:51.080 --> 00:02:52.080
Heroes...

00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:53.750
What was it? It sounded cool! 

00:02:53.750 --> 00:02:55.080
I want to say it, too!

00:02:57.870 --> 00:02:59.500
They need to raise their levels.

00:02:59.500 --> 00:03:00.370
Exactly!

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:03.370
This is the First Ever "Colors Hide-and-Seek Drill!"

00:03:03.580 --> 00:03:04.660
Oh! There's an ogre!

00:03:05.080 --> 00:03:06.870
Okay, Leader, you'll be It!

00:03:07.120 --> 00:03:08.580
THAT's why?

00:03:08.830 --> 00:03:10.370
Why hide-and-seek?

00:03:11.330 --> 00:03:12.870
Because I want to play it!

00:03:14.700 --> 00:03:17.250
What? That's all?

00:03:17.450 --> 00:03:22.660
Yup! And hey, hide-and-seek is good training

00:03:17.450 --> 00:03:22.660
in both hiding and seeking, right?

00:03:23.000 --> 00:03:25.830
You just came up with that right now.

00:03:28.040 --> 00:03:29.080
Okay, Yui!

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:31.120
Count to 30 and come find us!

00:03:31.290 --> 00:03:32.080
Okay!

00:03:32.410 --> 00:03:35.160
One! Two!

00:03:35.410 --> 00:03:38.410
Three! Four!

00:03:38.410 --> 00:03:41.410
Five! Six! Seven!

00:03:41.410 --> 00:03:44.910
Twenty-seven! Twenty-eight!

00:03:44.910 --> 00:03:47.410
Twenty-nine! Thirty!

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:50.250
Okay! I'm gonna find you so fast!

00:03:54.910 --> 00:03:56.080
She's gone!

00:03:58.370 --> 00:04:00.950
This is what it means

00:03:58.370 --> 00:04:00.950
to blow what's right under your nose!

00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:04.660
Oh, Koto-chan, is that a new game?

00:04:05.000 --> 00:04:05.750
Yeah.

00:04:06.200 --> 00:04:08.660
You sure like your video games.

00:04:08.950 --> 00:04:09.870
Yep.

00:04:11.410 --> 00:04:12.620
Do you like that one?

00:04:17.910 --> 00:04:20.330
Oh, that's a good smile.

00:04:20.330 --> 00:04:22.620
This game actually shows the blood.

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:27.830
But I can't get a lot of Road Passes in the park.

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:29.660
Road Passes?

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:33.830
If you pass by someone with the same game,

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:33.830
you get bonuses.

00:04:33.830 --> 00:04:35.330
Uh-huh...

00:04:36.790 --> 00:04:39.620
So we need to go somewhere with more people?

00:04:40.120 --> 00:04:41.580
Yeah, pretty much.

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:44.040
Okay, let's go hang out in front of the station!

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:54.330
Off to the station!

00:04:54.330 --> 00:05:01.200
No Trespassing

00:04:55.200 --> 00:04:56.700
They're not here.

00:04:57.950 --> 00:05:01.250
Come to think of it,

00:04:57.950 --> 00:05:01.250
how far are we going for this game?

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:05.080
We should have decided on a range.

00:05:06.160 --> 00:05:09.250
But they wouldn't go outside the park, right?

00:05:09.540 --> 00:05:11.700
And definitely not towards the station.

00:05:13.410 --> 00:05:14.580
The station!

00:05:14.580 --> 00:05:16.200
Time to pass people!

00:05:19.910 --> 00:05:23.000
Oh, I'm getting some good Road Passes!

00:05:24.660 --> 00:05:26.200
There's another one!

00:05:27.290 --> 00:05:29.200
The station is THE place to go!

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:32.410
The station's the place to go for what?

00:05:33.950 --> 00:05:35.290
Saito?

00:05:36.290 --> 00:05:38.040
What are YOU doing here?

00:05:38.040 --> 00:05:39.040
Ditching work?

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:40.660
I'm on patrol.

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:41.790
You got a problem with that?

00:05:41.790 --> 00:05:44.080
He says he's "on patrol," Koto-chan!

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:45.290
What a lazy bum.

00:05:45.620 --> 00:05:47.370
Who are you calling lazy?

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:50.120
And what are you brats doing, anyway?

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:52.250
Road Pass. So?

00:05:52.250 --> 00:05:54.000
NOW who's the lazy bum?

00:05:54.410 --> 00:05:56.080
We're not lazy!

00:05:56.080 --> 00:05:58.540
Listen, buddy. Heroes need...

00:05:59.450 --> 00:06:00.580
What was it again?

00:06:00.580 --> 00:06:02.370
They need to raise their levels.

00:06:02.700 --> 00:06:05.290
And they can't do it if they blow what's under their nose!

00:06:05.540 --> 00:06:07.750
Huh? What are you talking a-

00:06:10.200 --> 00:06:13.580
Don't you girls know about the Road Pass Plaza?

00:06:13.790 --> 00:06:15.580
Road Pass Plaza?

00:06:15.790 --> 00:06:18.700
Oh, right, I'm so sorry.

00:06:18.870 --> 00:06:22.870
It would take an entire half hour

00:06:18.870 --> 00:06:22.870
for brats like you to walk there from here.

00:06:23.370 --> 00:06:26.080
You couldn't possibly go there.

00:06:26.080 --> 00:06:28.580
We can walk that far, no sweat!

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:36.950
Where is this place? He said we just have to

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:36.950
follow the overhead train tracks.

00:06:37.450 --> 00:06:39.000
Let's go, Koto-chan!

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:45.200
Road Pass plaza!

00:06:46.370 --> 00:06:49.000
I'm confused, is it a road or a plaza?

00:06:56.330 --> 00:06:57.910
I've done it!

00:06:57.910 --> 00:07:00.290
I've driven those snot-nosed brats out of my town!

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:05.500
Please, if you witness any collisions

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:05.500
of bicycles or other vehicles,

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:05.500
contact us immediately.

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:21.950
This is it!

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:24.000
Special Monster

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:24.000
Road Pass Giveaway

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:24.000
How do I get the special monster in

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:24.000
"Fantasy Quest Monsters:

00:07:22.330 --> 00:07:24.000
Door to the Djinn & Fata Dungeon"?

00:07:27.500 --> 00:07:28.790
So many people!

00:07:28.790 --> 00:07:30.500
And they're all grownups!

00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:31.830
Lazy bums!

00:07:37.120 --> 00:07:39.450
Hey, mister! You look nice! 

00:07:39.450 --> 00:07:41.160
Will you give me your game?

00:07:41.750 --> 00:07:44.910
It's just... I don't have my own game.

00:07:45.410 --> 00:07:47.580
So won't you let me have yours?

00:07:50.500 --> 00:07:51.870
I'll scream.

00:07:57.330 --> 00:07:58.790
Next time, okay?

00:08:05.660 --> 00:08:07.450
Sat-chan!

00:08:07.700 --> 00:08:09.370
Kotoha!

00:08:09.660 --> 00:08:11.500
Sat-chan!

00:08:12.120 --> 00:08:14.750
I've been seeking for three hours!

00:08:14.750 --> 00:08:16.870
Where are you hiding?

00:08:17.040 --> 00:08:19.330
This park is way too big!

00:08:19.790 --> 00:08:25.040
If they left the park, then I'll NEVER find them.

00:08:34.290 --> 00:08:35.370
Huh?

00:08:35.370 --> 00:08:39.000
Weren't you with the other two?

00:08:45.080 --> 00:08:47.000
Sat-chan!

00:08:47.000 --> 00:08:49.200
Kotoha!

00:08:49.200 --> 00:08:51.540
H-hey, wait a minute!

00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:54.540
Where did you go?!

00:08:57.250 --> 00:08:58.120
I'll tell you!

00:08:58.120 --> 00:08:59.910
I'll tell you, just stop crying!

00:09:11.330 --> 00:09:13.910
Mmm... Manure?

00:09:14.830 --> 00:09:15.910
Snack time!

00:09:15.910 --> 00:09:17.290
It's five o'clock.

00:09:17.290 --> 00:09:18.330
You're kidding!

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:20.660
Huh?

00:09:21.040 --> 00:09:22.120
Where's Yui?

00:09:26.450 --> 00:09:28.040
I found you!

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:32.540
What's wrong with you? Crying like a baby!

00:09:32.540 --> 00:09:34.580
And what are you wear-

00:09:34.580 --> 00:09:35.410
Oh!

00:09:35.660 --> 00:09:37.000
You're It in tag!

00:09:37.000 --> 00:09:39.290
Hide-and-seek, remember?! Stupid dummy head!

00:09:39.290 --> 00:09:42.330
Do you realize where you are? This is Akihabara!

00:09:42.540 --> 00:09:44.120
That's two whole stations away!

00:09:44.120 --> 00:09:45.580
How deep do you need to hide?!

00:09:45.580 --> 00:09:46.950
You must be really shy!

00:09:47.250 --> 00:09:49.290
Your quips are scary.

00:09:49.620 --> 00:09:51.000
Sorry, really.

00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:54.290
Believe it or not, at first you blew

00:09:51.000 --> 00:09:54.290
what was right under your nose.

00:09:54.290 --> 00:09:56.200
You mean I couldn't see right under my nose!

00:09:56.200 --> 00:09:58.580
I can't see you if you go too far away, either!

00:09:59.870 --> 00:10:01.700
I got a lot of Road Passes.

00:10:01.700 --> 00:10:03.950
Yeah! And passed right over my feelings, too!

00:10:08.540 --> 00:10:10.910
Clean Up Project?

00:10:10.910 --> 00:10:13.700
Yeah. Since summer break is coming up.

00:10:13.700 --> 00:10:15.660
We'll have a lot of people coming through.

00:10:15.660 --> 00:10:17.290
You look dorky, Pops!

00:10:17.290 --> 00:10:19.830
So we're cleaning up the town?

00:10:19.830 --> 00:10:21.950
It's more than just that.

00:10:22.200 --> 00:10:25.160
The point is to pretty up Shopping Street.

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:28.330
We'll be counting on your help, Colors.

00:10:28.500 --> 00:10:29.700
Well, don't!

00:10:31.540 --> 00:10:34.620
Ameyoko

00:10:32.750 --> 00:10:34.910
It's almost time for summer vacation!

00:10:34.910 --> 00:10:36.620
The season of fairs and festivals.

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:39.750
My school is doing a Sansa dance in the parade.

00:10:39.750 --> 00:10:40.950
Come see me!

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:46.250
Note: Lyrics to the Sansa Odori song.

00:10:41.250 --> 00:10:43.250
Hara-hara-harase!

00:10:43.250 --> 00:10:46.250
Sakkora, choi wayasse!

00:10:46.540 --> 00:10:47.540
What IS that?

00:10:47.540 --> 00:10:49.580
Adora-dora-dorable!

00:10:49.580 --> 00:10:52.700
Sat-chan is adorable! Yeah!

00:10:52.950 --> 00:10:54.500
That's not how it goes!

00:10:54.500 --> 00:10:56.660
Hara-hara-harase!

00:10:56.660 --> 00:10:59.750
Sakkora, choi wayasse!

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:03.200
Sat-chan is adorable! Yay!

00:11:03.370 --> 00:11:04.910
No!

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:10.200
No Entry

00:11:08.040 --> 00:11:09.620
No entry?

00:11:10.410 --> 00:11:11.700
What's that about?

00:11:12.450 --> 00:11:14.450
Why no entry?

00:11:15.830 --> 00:11:18.870
Shopping

00:11:15.830 --> 00:11:18.870
Arcade

00:11:15.830 --> 00:11:18.870
Entrance

00:11:16.450 --> 00:11:17.700
Let's enter and see!

00:11:17.700 --> 00:11:18.910
They're going in!

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:20.830
But we're not supposed to go in!

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:22.120
Is there something in here?

00:11:22.290 --> 00:11:25.200
Maybe we'll find the chalk outline from a murder.

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:28.200
Ugh, you guys are hopeless.

00:11:28.500 --> 00:11:29.950
Did you find anything?

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:31.120
No.

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:32.160
There's nothing here!

00:11:32.370 --> 00:11:34.910
Then I wonder why there's no entry.

00:11:37.750 --> 00:11:39.120
Suspicious.

00:11:39.250 --> 00:11:41.620
I smell a crime.

00:11:41.620 --> 00:11:42.870
Hey!

00:11:43.620 --> 00:11:45.410
You're not supposed to go in there!

00:11:45.410 --> 00:11:48.000
Didn't you see the sign?

00:11:48.000 --> 00:11:49.200
We've been spotted!

00:11:49.200 --> 00:11:50.540
Run!

00:11:50.540 --> 00:11:51.620
Uh, hey!

00:11:58.410 --> 00:11:59.830
We got in trouble!

00:12:00.120 --> 00:12:03.080
It would seem they really are barring entry.

00:12:03.080 --> 00:12:05.120
But there wasn't anything there.

00:12:05.290 --> 00:12:06.950
What do you think, Kotoha?

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:09.080
I've come up with three scenarios.

00:12:09.250 --> 00:12:12.040
First, there WAS something, we just couldn't see it.

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:17.330
It could be some kind of gas, or maybe something

00:12:12.040 --> 00:12:17.330
we couldn't spot from our eye level,

00:12:17.330 --> 00:12:20.410
but that easily falls into an adult's field of vision.

00:12:21.450 --> 00:12:23.120
You're amazing, Kotoha!

00:12:23.750 --> 00:12:25.540
The second is timing.

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:33.410
Something happens there at specific times,

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:33.410
but those times are not when we were in there.

00:12:33.830 --> 00:12:36.250
Like poop falling from the sky?

00:12:37.330 --> 00:12:38.660
Well, something like that.

00:12:39.250 --> 00:12:42.410
Third, and this is the most interesting...

00:12:43.790 --> 00:12:46.080
No Entry

00:12:44.040 --> 00:12:45.830
There's another one!

00:12:46.290 --> 00:12:48.500
There wasn't a sign at this alley yesterday, either.

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:51.200
Let's check it out!

00:12:51.500 --> 00:12:52.700
They're going in again!

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:54.410
It could be dangerous!

00:12:54.410 --> 00:12:56.790
Let's check the high places this time.

00:12:56.790 --> 00:12:59.750
Ugh, you guys are hopeless.

00:13:00.040 --> 00:13:01.660
Is there anything here?

00:13:01.830 --> 00:13:02.700
Nope!

00:13:03.700 --> 00:13:06.250
Not even in the high places.

00:13:06.540 --> 00:13:07.750
Above us?

00:13:08.290 --> 00:13:10.120
No, nothing.

00:13:10.120 --> 00:13:12.700
So it has to be gas or timing?

00:13:14.620 --> 00:13:18.080
But it's strange that it would happen

00:13:14.620 --> 00:13:18.080
in two different places at the same time.

00:13:19.160 --> 00:13:20.410
Which means...

00:13:22.290 --> 00:13:23.290
Hey!

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:27.290
You went in again?!

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:27.290
You're not supposed to go in here, either!

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:28.750
Him again!

00:13:28.750 --> 00:13:30.540
How did he know where to find us?

00:13:30.790 --> 00:13:34.000
Let's beat him up and get him to spill the beans

00:13:30.790 --> 00:13:34.000
on why there's no entry!

00:13:34.580 --> 00:13:35.370
No, don't!

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:36.410
Run away!

00:13:37.200 --> 00:13:38.370
Oh, come on!

00:13:40.000 --> 00:13:41.410
Why are we running?

00:13:41.580 --> 00:13:44.750
He's the criminal who roped off these alleys!

00:13:44.870 --> 00:13:46.580
Criminal? Why?!

00:13:46.950 --> 00:13:49.750
Is that how he knew where we were?

00:13:49.910 --> 00:13:51.160
Exactly.

00:13:51.750 --> 00:13:55.750
The third possibility: he made the alleys off-limits

00:13:51.750 --> 00:13:55.750
so he could hide something in them.

00:13:58.000 --> 00:14:00.910
This could be a murder and dismemberment case.

00:14:01.080 --> 00:14:03.040
Murder and dismemberment case?

00:14:03.700 --> 00:14:04.910
Like a recipe?

00:14:09.620 --> 00:14:11.200
That's "measurement."

00:14:12.120 --> 00:14:13.580
No Entry

00:14:13.620 --> 00:14:15.620
Another no entry sign.

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:18.450
Don't be alarmed if you see a head on the ground.

00:14:19.500 --> 00:14:20.870
Who'd be alarmed about that?

00:14:20.870 --> 00:14:22.290
I would!

00:14:22.290 --> 00:14:25.410
If it really is a murder, you could get hurt!

00:14:25.830 --> 00:14:28.080
Ugh, you guys are hopeless.

00:14:28.080 --> 00:14:29.000
Oof.

00:14:29.870 --> 00:14:31.410
Did you find anything?

00:14:32.870 --> 00:14:33.620
Nope!

00:14:34.250 --> 00:14:35.700
There's nothing here.

00:14:37.950 --> 00:14:39.200
You went in another one!

00:14:40.250 --> 00:14:41.370
It's him again!

00:14:41.540 --> 00:14:43.040
There IS something here!

00:14:43.040 --> 00:14:44.000
Let's find it!

00:14:44.160 --> 00:14:46.080
Okay, I'll buy us some time!

00:14:46.080 --> 00:14:47.750
You two find whatever it is!

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:49.120
Sat-chan!

00:14:50.040 --> 00:14:51.120
Killer move!

00:14:51.120 --> 00:14:52.750
Extra...

00:14:52.750 --> 00:14:54.750
Virgin...

00:14:54.750 --> 00:14:55.830
Oil!

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:57.870
Oy.

00:14:57.870 --> 00:14:58.620
Oil!

00:14:59.200 --> 00:15:01.410
Th-there's nothing here, Kotoha!

00:15:01.660 --> 00:15:04.370
Yui, don't you have any ideas?

00:15:04.370 --> 00:15:06.500
Ideas? I don't know...

00:15:06.830 --> 00:15:09.540
Something you noticed that's different from yesterday.

00:15:09.830 --> 00:15:10.910
It could be anything.

00:15:10.910 --> 00:15:12.080
Anything?

00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:13.200
Oil!

00:15:13.200 --> 00:15:16.080
The Clean Up Project is starting today.

00:15:16.370 --> 00:15:18.290
Clean Up Project?

00:15:18.540 --> 00:15:20.080
The one Pops told us about.

00:15:21.370 --> 00:15:22.200
Of course!

00:15:22.870 --> 00:15:23.910
This is it!

00:15:25.540 --> 00:15:27.330
I've beat this game!

00:15:27.830 --> 00:15:29.660
There it is!

00:15:32.290 --> 00:15:35.290
Come on, what is this here?

00:15:35.950 --> 00:15:37.330
Must be Colors.

00:15:37.830 --> 00:15:40.750
It's easy to see exactly where they've been.

00:15:41.950 --> 00:15:45.250
Those places were all covered in wet paint.

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:46.660
Give me a break.

00:15:47.000 --> 00:15:49.450
Extra...

00:15:49.450 --> 00:15:51.330
Virgin Oil!

00:15:55.000 --> 00:15:58.790
Ameyoko

00:15:59.040 --> 00:16:00.950
Here you go. Natto.

00:16:01.120 --> 00:16:03.450
Yay! Thanks, Mom!

00:16:03.660 --> 00:16:05.700
And here are yours, Koto-chan, Yui-chan.

00:16:05.700 --> 00:16:06.580
Thanks.

00:16:06.580 --> 00:16:07.910
Thank you!

00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:12.790
What are you doing with this natto, anyway?

00:16:08.200 --> 00:16:12.790
Another prank on Saito-kun?

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:14.750
Nuh-uh.

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:17.200
We're gonna throw it in the pond!

00:16:17.200 --> 00:16:18.160
Hold up.

00:16:22.080 --> 00:16:24.200
She said we can't throw it in the pond.

00:16:26.080 --> 00:16:27.790
So what do we do?

